{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/468caec6046d02f0284661323ef7518e.poster.avif?t=1761077314\" width=1124 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/468caec6046d02f0284661323ef7518e.webm?t=1761077314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/468caec6046d02f0284661323ef7518e.mp4?t=1761077314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noslrac is a content-rich 2D dungeon crawler ARPG featuring four distinct classes, each with unique playstyles and skill trees. Take control of your conqueror, master powerful combat systems, chain devastating abilities, and defeat Noslrac\u2019s relentless minions to gain formidable power and find the cure for the dying King of Banglesway before all hope is lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/9c28fa753780b3e0ac42809972cef685.poster.avif?t=1761077314\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/9c28fa753780b3e0ac42809972cef685.webm?t=1761077314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/9c28fa753780b3e0ac42809972cef685.mp4?t=1761077314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four unique classes, each with differing playstyles, combat styles, and skill trees for your campaign in defeating Noslrac and his undying horde. Will you take up the mantle of the Champion and smash your enemies with powerful blows, or will you master the elements with the Wizard and rain fire and meteors from afar? Whichever your style, there\u2019s a class ready for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class features a unique talent tree that expands and enhances your core combat style. Earn skill points as you level up and invest them to further increase your strength to dominate the most powerful of foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/e1a7b770086360641cb26e490380fdb1.poster.avif?t=1761077314\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/e1a7b770086360641cb26e490380fdb1.webm?t=1761077314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/e1a7b770086360641cb26e490380fdb1.mp4?t=1761077314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to earn keys that unlock Onslaughts, powerful dungeons with ever-increasing difficulty and rewards. Venture into their depths and cut down relentless hordes of enemies and discover powerful loot. Every Onslaught features three unique modifiers, making every run a fresh and challenging experience. Conqueror the Onslaught, and you will be rewarded handsomely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate resources from your conquests to craft potent and fully customizable items. Whether you forge a chest plate that increases your damage or a weapon that restores life with every kill, the choice is ultimately yours. Combine any modifiers, sockets, and power you want to create the perfect arsenal and tailor your conqueror and their items to how your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/ff08ba6b0b2da8afffefd81382e0b0cc.poster.avif?t=1761077314\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/ff08ba6b0b2da8afffefd81382e0b0cc.webm?t=1761077314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/extras/ff08ba6b0b2da8afffefd81382e0b0cc.mp4?t=1761077314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Four distinct classes, each with unique skill trees, tier sets, and unique items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Cohesive and dynamic combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Endless endgame progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Randomly generated and fully customizable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Over 50 achievements to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Campaign editor for creating your own adventures.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2184030?t=1761077314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761077314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761077314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761077314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","i